{"uid":"5efb7e49db964436","name":"The refresh token was spent outside the browser USER_MANAGER = ROTATION_SAFE","fullName":"application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.TokenRenewalAcrossTabsTest.refreshTokenSpentElsewhere","historyId":"4b17a4d5ef655513d226ae506ab35947","time":{"start":1792662023325,"stop":1792662060892,"duration":37567},"description":"The test takes the refresh token the application keeps in the browser and spends it once itself, without touching the application at all. The renewal of the application is then a second use of the same token, and the provider refuses it. Expected with 'rotationSafe': the token is burnt instead of being presented again, and the renewal goes on through the hidden iframe, which asks with the SSO session cookie. The user sees nothing, and a fresh refresh token appears in the storage. (Where the browser keeps its cookie out of the iframe the popup comes instead.) Expected with 'original': nothing else is tried, and when the access token is over the popup \"Session has expired\" opens.","descriptionHtml":"The test takes the refresh token the application keeps in the browser and spends it once itself, without touching the application at all. The renewal of the application is then a second use of the same token, and the provider refuses it. Expected with 'rotationSafe': the token is burnt instead of being presented again, and the renewal goes on through the hidden iframe, which asks with the SSO session cookie. The user sees nothing, and a fresh refresh token appears in the storage. (Where the browser keeps its cookie out of the iframe the popup comes instead.) Expected with 'original': nothing else is tried, and when the access token is over the popup \"Session has expired\" opens.\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Manual run:</strong> <code>  \uD83D\uDCCB Copy  application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.TokenRenewalAcrossTabsTest#refreshTokenSpentElsewhere </code> into <a href=\"https://github.com/CX-Box/cxbox-code-samples/actions/workflows/bui